# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers regardless of what platform
# checked them out. Without this, Windows' core.autocrlf=true rewrites LF
# to CRLF on checkout and every script breaks with `$'\r': command not found`
# the moment it runs in a container -- confirmed the hard way against
# services/kafka/create_topics.sh.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
*.cql text eol=lf
